sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant P1 as Pod A
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>(checkpointer)
  participant H as Approver
  participant P2 as Pod B

  U->>P1: "email ops about incident 4471"
  P1->>P1: prepare node runs
  P1->>DB: checkpoint
  P1->>P1: approval node: interrupt(payload)
  P1->>DB: checkpoint — run is now a ROW
  P1-->>U: __interrupt__ returned, request ends
  Note over P1: Pod A holds nothing.<br/>It can be terminated now.

  Note over DB,H: hours or days pass

  H->>P2: POST /resume {thread_id, decision}
  P2->>DB: load checkpoint by thread_id
  Note over P2: Pod B never saw the original run
  P2->>P2: approval node RESTARTS from the top
  P2->>P2: interrupt() replays the answer, returns immediately
  P2->>P2: send node runs
  P2->>DB: checkpoint
  P2-->>H: done
